{"asset_key":"ep1/quest_story_11105210","episode":"ep1","category":"quest_story","story_id":"11105210","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1110521001:0":{"text":"뭐, 뭘 어쩌려고요?","source_cn":"你、你们想干什么？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC4C08E3F17331FE1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1110521002:0":{"text":"이, 이거 놔요! 아파요!","source_cn":"你、抓得我好痛！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEC3209F801D15EC2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1110521003:1":{"text":"아르사! 젠장...!","source_cn":"阿尔萨……可恶！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x57CEE0CDE94ACDE4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1110521004:1":{"text":"이건 평범한 칼이 아닌 거 같아요. 아르사의 몸이 너무 뜨거워요...","source_cn":"这把匕首可能有问题，阿尔萨的身体好烫……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF3800047D06F548D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1110521005:1":{"text":"칼에 독이 묻었나?","source_cn":"匕首上淬了毒？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFA001AE1BCC734F2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1110521006:1":{"text":"소렌, 진정해요! 지금은 아르사를 구하는 게 더 중요해요!","source_cn":"索恩，你冷静点！现在最要紧的是救阿尔萨！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDF08FFEBB40774FD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1110521007:1":{"text":"꼬마야, 이 칼에 어떤 독이 묻었는지 알아?","source_cn":"那个小蛮血，你知道这把匕首上涂的是什么毒药吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x35BDB4CE183BC147","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1110521008:1":{"text":"독이요? 저는 잘 몰라요... 전 그저 먹을 걸 준다는 말에 상인 아저씨가 시키는 대로 누나에게 장난을 쳤을 뿐이에요...","source_cn":"毒药？我不知道……只、只是有个商人叔叔找到我，给我食物...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x35573616DDFE0B02","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1110521009:1":{"text":"그 상인... 지금 어디에 있지?","source_cn":"那商人，现在在哪里？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0344071E5CCB5C4B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1110521010:1":{"text":"모르겠어요... 그 상인 아저씨는 트라이브가 아니었어요. 이미 떠났을 걸요?","source_cn":"我不知道……那个商人叔叔不是蛮血，可能走掉了吧？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x615B528308A41811","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:16:1110521010":{"text":"모르겠어요... 그 상인 아저씨는 트라이브가 아니었어요. 이미 떠났을 걸요?","source_cn":"我不知道……那个商人叔叔不是蛮血，可能走掉了吧？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x615B528308A41811","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1110521011:1":{"text":"블랙골드 상회를... 말씀하시는 거죠? 뒤에서 몰래 일을 꾸미는 게 정말 비슷하긴 해요!","source_cn":"主人是想起了……黑金商会？这种暗中搞事的感觉，确实很像！","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x2F5CA1BFBD511269","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"블랙골드 상회를... 말씀하시는 거죠? 뒤에서 몰래 일을 꾸미는 게 정말 비슷하긴 해요!","female":"블랙골드 상회를... 말씀하시는 거죠? 뒤에서 몰래 일을 꾸미는 게 정말 비슷하긴 해요!","variant_male_record_index":"120357","variant_female_record_index":"120358","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1110521013:1":{"text":"진짜 블랙골드 상회라고 해도 왜 갑자기 아르사한테 이런 짓을 하는 거죠? 뭔가 이상한데요...","source_cn":"不过如果真的是黑金商会，他们为什么会盯上阿尔萨？好奇怪啊……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x730147BAB0BE7C38","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1110521014:1":{"text":"블랙골드 상회가 뭔데?","source_cn":"你们说的黑金商会，是什么意思？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1987337F44D9DEAE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1110521015:1":{"text":"아주 나쁜 놈들이에요! 진짜 블랙골드 상회가 저지른 짓이라면 아마 해독약을 구하기 힘들 거예요...","source_cn":"就是一个坏蛋组织！如果真的是黑金商会，那么解药肯定很难...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF62DC008DE92E8B9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:24:1110521016:1":{"text":"알겠어. 그럼, 너도 해독약은 없다는 거지?","source_cn":"我明白了。看来你也没有解药，对吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x46F5BA4CD4C5642D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:26:1110521017:1":{"text":"미안해요, 형아. 배가 너무 고파서 그만...","source_cn":"对不起，大哥哥，我太饿了……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB3376FE151F1CFF9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:27:1110521018:1":{"text":"닥치고 꺼져...","source_cn":"闭嘴。快滚……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8C0750EEADE02C17","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:28:1110521019:1":{"text":"나는 아르사가 아니야. 혼쭐나기 싫으면 앞으로 내 앞에 얼씬도 하지 마!","source_cn":"我不是阿尔萨。不想吃苦头的话，之后就别出现在我面前！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB32BF9AAFC4BB3FB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:30:1110521020:1":{"text":"맙소사, 석양의 신이시여! 아르사가 다친 건가요? 어서 쉴 수 있게 저쪽 텐트로 데려가 주세요...","source_cn":"残阳神啊！阿尔萨这是受伤了吗？快带她去那顶帐篷里休息……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x52094FF5EA20AF16","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:31:1110521021:1":{"text":"고마워... 칼라...","source_cn":"谢谢你……曼卡拉……","status":"matched","